      "kind": "parser_admitted"
    },
    {
      "file": "libass/ass.c",
      "function": "process_event_tail",
      "line": 353,
      "code": "event->Text = strdup(p);",
      "note": "Source. `process_event_tail()` first materializes the attacker-controlled `Text` field as heap string `event->Text`. For the witness this duplicates the exact event text `{\\fn@}`, creating the 7-byte allocation that later holds the `\\fn` argument and is over-read at the sink.",
      "kind": "source"
    },
